{
  "about": "Gateway 记账的任务预算（sdkSessionConfig.taskBudget，美元）：InProcessGateway.ts:1134-1181 提交前取 taskBudgetSnapshot（ProjectRuntimeRegistry.ts:1058-1072），spent >= total 时直接回 error agent_task_budget_reached（recoverable false、userHint）与 turn_completed finishReason task_budget，不发模型请求；否则把 taskBudgetUsd / initialTaskBudgetSpentUsd 交给循环（:1555-1557）。循环按 provider usage 的 cost 累计（AgentLoop.ts:370-377、977-1022），越过 total 时 agent_status task_budget_reached、error agent_task_budget_reached、stopReason task_budget。turn_completed 带 result.budget.taskBudgetUsd 时 recordTaskBudgetSpendForSdk 追加 settled 记录到 <pilotHome>/gateway/sdk-task-budget-ledger.jsonl（ProjectRuntimeRegistry.ts:1375-1406、1511-1513）。s-tb 每轮花 0.02、total 0.05：第一、二轮正常结束，第三轮累计 0.06 在轮内越线；重启后第四轮读回账本、提交前就拒绝；另一会话 s-tb2 有自己的账本照常。",
  "server": false,
  "files": {
    "home/.pilotdeck/a.txt": "alpha\n"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\":\"Task budget\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "spend",
      "when": [
        "tb1:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "One.",
        "usage": {
          "prompt_tokens": 12,
          "completion_tokens": 4,
          "total_tokens": 16,
          "cost": 0.02
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "other",
      "reply": {
        "text": "Other.",
        "usage": {
          "prompt_tokens": 12,
          "completion_tokens": 4,
          "total_tokens": 16,
          "cost": 0.001
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "serve": [
        "server"
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "ws": "submit_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-tb",
            "channelKey": "test",
            "message": "tb1: spend",
            "sdkSessionConfig": {
              "taskBudget": {
                "total": 0.05
              }
            }
          },
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        {
          "sleep": 300
        },
        {
          "ws": "submit_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-tb",
            "channelKey": "test",
            "message": "tb2: spend more",
            "sdkSessionConfig": {
              "taskBudget": {
                "total": 0.05
              }
            }
          },
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        {
          "sleep": 300
        },
        {
          "ws": "submit_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-tb",
            "channelKey": "test",
            "message": "tb3: refused",
            "sdkSessionConfig": {
              "taskBudget": {
                "total": 0.05
              }
            }
          },
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        {
          "sleep": 300
        },
        {
          "ws": "read_session_messages",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-tb"
          }
        },
        {
          "disconnect": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "serve": [
        "server"
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "connect": true
        },
        {
          "ws": "submit_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-tb",
            "channelKey": "test",
            "message": "tb4: after restart",
            "sdkSessionConfig": {
              "taskBudget": {
                "total": 0.05
              }
            }
          },
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        {
          "sleep": 300
        },
        {
          "ws": "submit_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-tb2",
            "channelKey": "test",
            "message": "tb5: another session",
            "sdkSessionConfig": {
              "taskBudget": {
                "total": 0.05
              }
            }
          },
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        {
          "sleep": 300
        },
        {
          "disconnect": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "name": "loop-task-budget"
}
